{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is dying one star at a time, and your civilization is next. In <strong>Nullpoint Protocol</strong>, you and up to three allies face the void\u2019s deadliest shepherds in a roguelite boss-rush where every encounter delivers the intensity and precision of a high-level MMO raid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you brave the void alone or face the darkness alongside trusty allies, difficulty scales to match your squad. Every run feels challenging but fair, and always tempting you into \u201djust one more try.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss unleashes complex attack patterns that must be learned, read, and dodged. Every run is another chance to sharpen your skills as you prepare to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay alert: attack patterns change from run to run. No boss fight is ever the same twice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each Void Shepherd slain, you are rewarded with a random selection of ability upgrades. From meteor strikes to turrets to healing powers, crafting creative and powerful skill combinations is critical to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold choices will shape your path forward. Will you hunt down other adversaries, shop to optimize your build, or roll the dice on mystery events that could dramatically alter your entire run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars have begun to wink out, disappearing one by one. Upon discovering the monstrous Void Shepherds, your people have drawn their attention. Now they are coming after your species, but you will not go quietly into the night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and face the aberrations as they prey upon planets across the galaxy. Destroy these threats before they can drag more planets into oblivion and strengthen your body and mind as you prepare to face the Shepherds' creator, Void Genesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you fail, your civilization will be exterminated, and you will return eons later as a different species in yet another attempt to prevent apocalyptic catastrophe, lest the same tragedy happen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players (local* &amp; online co-op supported)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging boss fights with bullet hell-style attack patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft, experiment, and upgrade your skillset with randomized loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new ability packs, hub upgrades, lore journals, and brutal difficulty modifiers for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try your luck on mystery events that might shake up your entire run!<br><br>*controller required for local co-op</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520420?t=1773947947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/34f5213b6460bab0b02e9f9316bd297cc72e50a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773947947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/d87902f469e4b0c684496348a3a97ef1aa4bf8ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773947947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/d87902f469e4b0c684496348a3a97ef1aa4bf8ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773947947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4195070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/4990dfc2fd72ddcb33b771f3e8f5d0f5.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is dying one star at a time, and your civilization is next. In <strong>Nullpoint Protocol</strong>, you and up to three allies face the void\u2019s deadliest shepherds in a roguelite boss-rush where every encounter delivers the intensity and precision of a high-level MMO raid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/a05c2f981efb06854a823371c3df6eb2.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you brave the void alone or face the darkness alongside trusty allies, difficulty scales to match your squad. Every run feels challenging but fair, and always tempting you into \u201djust one more try.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/d600a78b1f981f93fee733f9439a15a4.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss unleashes complex attack patterns that must be learned, read, and dodged. Every run is another chance to sharpen your skills as you prepare to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay alert: attack patterns change from run to run. No boss fight is ever the same twice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/abec9d9831e654974883d0161575b196.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each Void Shepherd slain, you are rewarded with a random selection of ability upgrades. From meteor strikes to turrets to healing powers, crafting creative and powerful skill combinations is critical to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold choices will shape your path forward. Will you hunt down other adversaries, shop to optimize your build, or roll the dice on mystery events that could dramatically alter your entire run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.poster.avif?t=1773947947\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.webm?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/extras/e6d160bb73451b8912ad741338feb9ca.mp4?t=1773947947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars have begun to wink out, disappearing one by one. Upon discovering the monstrous Void Shepherds, your people have drawn their attention. Now they are coming after your species, but you will not go quietly into the night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and face the aberrations as they prey upon planets across the galaxy. Destroy these threats before they can drag more planets into oblivion and strengthen your body and mind as you prepare to face the Shepherds' creator, Void Genesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you fail, your civilization will be exterminated, and you will return eons later as a different species in yet another attempt to prevent apocalyptic catastrophe, lest the same tragedy happen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players (local* &amp; online co-op supported)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging boss fights with bullet hell-style attack patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft, experiment, and upgrade your skillset with randomized loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new ability packs, hub upgrades, lore journals, and brutal difficulty modifiers for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try your luck on mystery events that might shake up your entire run!<br><br>*controller required for local co-op</p>","developers":["Everbloom Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520420/2dc87b1daafddb0c0c9b7330c29b659a805ef2ef/header.jpg?t=1